  "description": "Ki-Su, who was forced to participate in a club MT, gets trapped in a haunted pension with his junior, Ju-Won, whom he dislikes. Ki-Su, who hates scary things, panics, and Ju-won says there's a way to chase away the ghosts...\n\nWait, why are you taking off your pants...?\n\n *\"There's something ghosts hate, right? Dirty things.\"*\n\nWill he be able to survive in this place, both physically and mentally...?\n\n(Source: Mr.Blue, translated)",
